  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For UAE residents, the Emirates ID is an identity card. Be it a citizen or an expatriate, all require it. A resident visa is issued after securing it. The card is actually more than just a piece of identification. Tied to your biometric data with fingerprints and an eye scan. Across the UAE, it serves as your gateway to accessing various government and private sector services.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The blog walks you through what you need to know about the following:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Checking the status of your Emirates ID application</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Along with renewal, or validity,</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stay on top of your UAE residency documents. Let’s avoid any hassles that may arise!</span></p>\n<div class=\"lwptoc lwptoc-autoWidth lwptoc-baseItems lwptoc-light lwptoc-notInherit\" data-smooth-scroll=\"1\" data-smooth-scroll-offset=\"24\"><div class=\"lwptoc_i\">    <div class=\"lwptoc_header\">\n        <b class=\"lwptoc_title\">Contents</b>                    <span class=\"lwptoc_toggle\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"lwptoc_toggle_label\" data-label=\"show\">hide</a>            </span>\n            </div>\n<div class=\"lwptoc_items lwptoc_items-visible\">\n    <div class=\"lwptoc_itemWrap\"><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#What_is_Emirates_ID_UAE\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">What is Emirates ID UAE?</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Key_Features_of_the_Emirates_ID\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Key Features of the Emirates ID</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Why_Check_Your_Emirates_ID_Status\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Why Check Your Emirates ID Status?</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#How_to_Check_Your_Emirates_ID_Status\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">How to Check Your Emirates ID Status</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#How_to_Track_Your_Emirates_ID_Status_via_the_Mobile_App\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">How to Track Your Emirates ID Status via the Mobile App</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#How_to_Get_an_Emirates_ID\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">How to Get an Emirates ID</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Emirates_ID_Renewal\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Emirates ID Renewal</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#What_to_Do_if_You_Lose_Your_Emirates_ID\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">What to Do if You Lose Your Emirates ID</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Key_Points_to_Remember\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Key Points to Remember</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#Conclusion\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">Conclusion</span>\n    </a>\n    </div><div class=\"lwptoc_item\">    <a href=\"#FAQs\">\n                <span class=\"lwptoc_item_label\">FAQs:</span>\n    </a>\n    </div></div></div>\n</div></div><h2 id=\"what-is-emirates-id-uae\"><b>What is Emirates ID UAE?</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Emirates ID UAE is an identification card for all UAE residents. It functions as an official proof of identity. The Emirates ID is issued once you obtain your <a href=\"/uae-residence-visa-rules/\">UAE residency visa</a>. It links your biometric data to your records. In the UAE, the card holds a prime role in daily life. Rely on it for various important activities:</span></p>\n<p><b>Government Services</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is required for accessing services. These include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dubai Electricity and Water Authority</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Healthcare and more.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Renting Property</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Emirates ID is needed for lease agreements if you’re moving into an apartment or house.</span></p>\n<p><b>Opening Bank Accounts</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID is required. Open bank accounts or get a loan in the UAE by having it</span></p>\n<p><b>Immigration</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With Emirates ID, you pass through e-gates easily at UAE airports</span></p>\n<p><b>Communication Services</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For setting up a mobile phone line or internet connection, you’ll need it</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Emirates ID UAE is a central piece of your identity.</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/contact-us/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-10450\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status-1024x562.webp\" alt=\"emirates id status\" width=\"1024\" height=\"562\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-10450\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status-1024x562.webp\" alt=\"emirates id status\" width=\"1024\" height=\"562\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status-1024x562.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status-300x165.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status-768x421.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/02/How-to-Check-Your-Emirates-ID-Status.webp 1500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></noscript></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"key-features-of-the-emirates-id\"><b>Key Features of the Emirates ID</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Emirates ID card boasts cutting-edge security features. This shows the integrity and authenticity of personal information. A detailed breakdown of its main characteristics:</span></p>\n<p><b>Smart Card Technology</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The card uses a sophisticated smart card system. It is used to store personal data securely.</span></p>\n<p><b>Biometric Data</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It holds your fingerprint and eye scan. In turn, it increases security and prevents identity theft.</span></p>\n<p><b>Unique ID Number</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every holder is assigned a 15-digit identification number. It serves as a lifelong ID in the UAE.</span></p>\n<p><b>Embedded Chip</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The ID has an electronic chip. It stores encrypted personal data. A way to ensure privacy and security.</span></p>\n<p><b>Security Features</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The card includes intricate</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Micro lettering</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UV ink, and</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Complex line patterns to prevent counterfeiting.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These features validate that the Emirates ID card is the most secure identification system in the world.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"why-check-your-emirates-id-status\"><b>Why Check Your Emirates ID Status?</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Knowing your Emirates ID status is important for several reasons:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can track your ID application process and ensure everything is on track.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check whether your Emirates ID has been issued/still pending.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Confirm if your Emirates ID is valid or has expired.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Identify where the process might have stalled if delayed</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take a look at how to check Emirates ID status.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-check-your-emirates-id-status\"><b>How to Check Your Emirates ID Status</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Checking your Emirates ID status process is quite simple. Do this online or through a mobile application. Here are the steps to follow:</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"visit-the-icp-website\"><strong>Visit the ICP website.</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Go to the official ICP website:</span> <a href=\"https://icp.gov.ae/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">icp.gov.ae</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Find the </span>“Check Application Status”<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> section. Just on the right side of the homepage.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"enter-your-details\"><strong>Enter Your Details</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Either your </span>Emirates ID number<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or your </span>Registration Application Number (PRAN) is needed.<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Check the Emirates ID application status.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To check your Emirates ID status, use your </span>passport number<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"check-the-status\"><strong>Check the Status</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You’ll be presented with your application status on entering the information. It could be one of the following:</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>Pending</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your Emirates ID application is being processed.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>Approved</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your application has been approved, and a card is being printed.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>Issued</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your Emirates ID has been printed. It is ready for collection.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"2\"><b>Rejected</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your application was rejected for some reason. Take corrective action.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"review-the-application-history-log\"><strong>Review the application history log.</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Additionally, the ICP website provides an </span>Application History Log<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that includes the key stages of your application, such as submission, data verification, and ID card printing. This can help you track the timeline and identify if there are any delays.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-track-your-emirates-id-status-via-the-mobile-app\"><b>How to Track Your Emirates ID Status via the Mobile App</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Track the status of your Emirates ID through the ICP mobile app. This way, you can track more conveniently. You can download the app. Install it on Android and iOS platforms. Check your application status with a few taps on your phone.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-get-an-emirates-id\"><b>How to Get an Emirates ID</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can apply for your UAE visa and Emirates ID at the same time. The following is an overview. Learn how to get your Emirates ID:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Complete the Residency Visa Application</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Your employer will initiate the <a href=\"/corporate-visa-processing/\">visa process</a>. In case you’re moving to the UAE for work.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Undergo a Medical Checkup</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: This is a mandatory step. The UAE requires you to meet health requirements to live there.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Apply for the Emirates ID</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Apply for your Emirates ID at an authorized office after medical checkup completion</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Biometric Data Collection</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Undergo biometric data collection. It includes fingerprinting and an eye scan during the Emirates ID application.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Visa and Emirates ID Issuance</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Emirates ID will be processed. It may be sent to you upon your visa approval.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The process takes 7-10 days after visa approval.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"emirates-id-renewal\"><b>Emirates ID Renewal</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID is valid for the same period as a <a href=\"/uae-residence-visa/\">residency visa</a>. Renew your Emirates ID if your visa is renewed.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-8705\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Emirates-ID-Renewal-visual-selection.png\" alt=\"Emirates ID Renewal\" width=\"681\" height=\"543\"><noscript><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-8705\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Emirates-ID-Renewal-visual-selection.png\" alt=\"Emirates ID Renewal\" width=\"681\" height=\"543\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Emirates-ID-Renewal-visual-selection.png 828w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Emirates-ID-Renewal-visual-selection-300x239.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Emirates-ID-Renewal-visual-selection-768x612.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 681px) 100vw, 681px\"></noscript></p>\n<p><b>Grace Period</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For Emirates ID renewal, there is a 30-day grace period. You are charged AED 50 per day for late renewal.</span></p>\n<p><b>SMS Reminders</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The ICP will send you SMS reminders to notify you. The notification arrives when it’s time to renew your Emirates ID.</span></p>\n<p><b>Renewal Process</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Renewing your Emirates ID is easy. It is done in conjunction with your <a href=\"/visa-renewal-dubai/\">visa renewal</a>. You will be issued your Emirates ID once your visa is renewed. Collect it from the nearest Emirates Post office.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"what-to-do-if-you-lose-your-emirates-id\"><b>What to Do if You Lose Your Emirates ID</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Losing your Emirates ID is inconvenient. However, it is still manageable. Below is a method. What you need to do:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>File a Police Report</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Visit the nearest police station. Then, file a report about the lost ID.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Notify ICP</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Inform the ICP within 7 days of the loss.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Apply for a Replacement</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Apply for a replacement ID at any ICA office. You can also do so via the ICP website. A replacement ID costs AED 300, and you can also opt for express service for an additional fee.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Collect Your New ID</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Once your replacement ID is ready, you can collect it from the nearest Emirates Post office.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"key-points-to-remember\"><b>Key Points to Remember</b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID status checking is a quick process. It is easy and free of charge.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your Emirates ID must be valid and up to date. It is essential for accessing government services. While conducting many activities in the UAE.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Renew your Emirates ID timely. This helps avoid fines and complications.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Act quickly to replace it if you lose your Emirates ID. This way, you can avoid identity theft</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"conclusion\"><b>Conclusion</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UAE Emirates ID is an integral part of life. It serves as an essential identification tool for residents. It helps check the status of your ID application. You can track its ID renewal while replacing a lost card. All of these require an Emirates ID understanding. An assurance to stay in compliance with UAE regulations. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Track your Emirates ID status easily by following the simple steps outlined in this guide. If you want assistance, reach out to <a href=\"/\">KPM PRO</a>! Their team assists you in keeping your documentation up to date. So that you will never stay behind the current requirement.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"faqs\"><strong>FAQs:</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"what-is-an-emirates-id\"><b>What is an Emirates ID?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In the UAE, an Emirates ID is your official identification card. The ID links your personal and biometric details.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-can-i-check-my-emirates-id-status-online\"><b>How can I check my Emirates ID status online?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can check your Emirates ID status online by:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visit the ICP website (</span><a href=\"http://icp.gov.ae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">icp.gov.ae</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enter your Emirates ID or PRAN number, and</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">View your current status.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"what-details-do-i-need-to-check-my-emirates-id-status\"><b>What details do I need to check my Emirates ID status?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To track your card status online, you only need your:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID number or</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Application (PRAN) number</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"what-should-i-do-if-my-emirates-id-is-delayed\"><b>What should I do if my Emirates ID is delayed?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check your application history on the ICP portal. Then contact ICP support to resolve any processing delays.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"can-i-check-the-status-of-my-emirates-id-renewal-or-replacement\"><b>Can I check the status of my Emirates ID renewal or replacement?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes! </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">To track renewal or replacement requests anytime, use the same ICP portal or mobile app.</span><br>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is an Emirates ID?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"In the UAE, an Emirates ID is your official identification card. The ID links your personal and biometric details.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How can I check my Emirates ID status online?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"You can check your Emirates ID status online by:</p>\n<p>Visit the ICP website (icp.gov.ae)\nEnter your Emirates ID or PRAN number, and\nView your current status.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What details do I need to check my Emirates ID status?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"To track your card status online, you only need your:</p>\n<p>Emirates ID number or\nApplication (PRAN) number\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What should I do if my Emirates ID is delayed?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Check your application history on the ICP portal. Then contact ICP support to resolve any processing delays.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I check the status of my Emirates ID renewal or replacement?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes! To track renewal or replacement requests anytime, use the same ICP portal or mobile app.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script><!-- Simple Share Buttons Adder (8.5.6) simplesharebuttons.com --></p>\n<div class=\"ssba-modern-2 ssba ssbp-wrap aligncenter ssbp--theme-8\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<ul class=\"ssbp-list\">\n<li class=\"ssbp-li--facebook\"><a data-site=\"facebook\" class=\"ssba_facebook_share ssba_share_link ssbp-facebook ssbp-btn\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?t=How%20to%20Check%20Your%20Emirates%20ID%20Status:%20Simple%20Steps&amp;u=/emirates-id-status/\" style=\"color:#4267B2; background-color: #4267B2; height: 48px; width: 48px; \"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"#fff\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\">\n  <g>\n    <path d=\"m21.7 16.7h5v5h-5v11.6h-5v-11.6h-5v-5h5v-2.1c0-2 0.6-4.5 1.8-5.9 1.3-1.3 2.8-2 4.7-2h3.5v5h-3.5c-0.9 0-1.5 0.6-1.5 1.5v3.5z\"></path>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n<p></p></span><span class=\"color-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 28\">\n  <path fill=\"#3B5998\" d=\"M10.7,10.7 L15.7,10.7 L15.7,15.7 L10.7,15.7 L10.7,27.3 L5.7,27.3 L5.7,15.7 L0.7,15.7 L0.7,10.7 L5.7,10.7 L5.7,8.6 C5.7,6.6 6.3,4.1 7.5,2.7 C8.8,1.4 10.3,0.7 12.2,0.7 L15.7,0.7 L15.7,5.7 L12.2,5.7 C11.3,5.7 10.7,6.3 10.7,7.2 L10.7,10.7 Z\"></path>\n</svg><br>\n</span>\n<div title=\"Facebook\" class=\"ssbp-text\">Facebook</div>\n<p></p></a></li>\n<li class=\"ssbp-li--twitter\"><a data-site=\"twitter\" class=\"ssba_twitter_share ssba_